  The source ranges below are T022 incidence, NOT the shifted table keys:
  0..20 deg: supplied T022 table, exact at its six nodes.
  20..40 deg CL/CD: estimated bridge between inconsistent supplied datasets.
  40..85 deg CL/CD: approximate readings from supplied T022 graphs (Re ~200000).
