  No Reynolds/Mach/sideslip/dynamic-stall or rate-damping data are supplied.

  Spear nose = -Z of the JSBSim BODY frame, not +X. T022 +Y = BODY +Y.
  Diagnostic T022 AoA = atan2(u_air_body, -w_air_body); NOT 90 + Euler pitch.
  Lookup uses native JSBSim relative-wind AoA; do NOT shift the input again.
  At level, zero-sideslip flight: Pitch -90/-70/-30/0 -> AoA 0/20/60/90.
  Wind-axis LIFT/DRAG need no additional 90-degree force rotation.
  CM is assumed about AERORP and referenced to metrics/cbarw-ft; verify source.
  JSBSim adds AERORP-to-CG force moments separately. Do not double-count them.
